# Testing

- Run on host: `poetry run pytest`; integration: `poetry run pytest -m integration` (Docker up).
- Mock Spark and DB in unit tests (`pytest-mock`); see `tests/conftest.py` fixtures.
- Integration tests need `POSTGRES_HOST=localhost` in `.env.local`.
- Sample IDs: `test-portfolio-123`, symbols `AAPL`, `MSFT`, `GOOGL`.
- After analytics changes: `./scripts/test-analytics.sh` in Spark container.
